: top\" width=\"10%\">\n                  <a href=\"#\"\n                    ><img\n                      src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNtdnMngU7j9l7ahetEDv6SqczX-YPorQjoU9Kl5EN5siZI06pmj3U-fpUcw6BfpbcNUc_EoIWQPAMDCUqfjS1_QNCpzvkEMFCD2YOO8buTduJnHWs=w2400\"\n                      alt=\"\"\n                      style=\"width: 200px; margin-bottom: 16px; display: block\"\n                  /></a>\n                </td> -->\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n          <!-- WELCOME MESSAGE MOBILE -->\n          <div\n            class=\"welcomeMobile\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px; background-color: #fef7ed\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              Welcoming Our New Clients in Virtual Assistance & Social Media\n              Management\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Virtual Assistant Solutions\n            </small>\n\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              We\'re excited to welcome our newest clients who have entrusted us\n              with their Virtual Assistant and Social Media Management needs! At\n              Frontline Business Solutions, we\'re committed to helping\n              businesses streamline operations and enhance their online\n              presence.\n            </p>\n\n            <ul style=\"list-style: none; text-align: center\">\n              <li>\n                <a href=\"#\"\n                  ><img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNfTex3xE76-6CADK0b8cNVYsBsebvnarT6DIm-FSDjfu02i0cejzosawR6EkX11rWmPf67iUOsExL5uspYjKCmOSCZ7jtRrkY228W9U2qSVJIiS6k=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n            