#d60070);\n                      border-radius: 5px;\n                      text-decoration: none;\n                      font-size: 12px;\n                    \"\n                    >Read more</a\n                  >\n                </div>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"renewalMobile--block2\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: left\">\n                  FBS is proud to announce the renewal of its partnership with\n                  San Pablo Colleges for their Senior High School Work Immersion\n                  Program this 2025. This continued collaboration underscores\n                  both institutions\' shared commitment to providing students\n                  with invaluable real-world experience and practical skills\n                  that will prepare them for future career success.\n                </p>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <!-- FELLOWSHIP -->\n          <div\n            class=\"fellowship\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px; background-color: #f2f2f2\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              February Company Fellowship\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Company Culture and Team Building\n            </small>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              As February is known as the month of love, Frontline Business\n              Solutions, Inc. embraced this spirit of unity and camaraderie\n              through our monthly company fellowship. With the theme \"Raising\n              the Bar, Reaching Far, the event served as a reminder of our\n              commitment to continuous growth, excellence, and teamwork.\n            </p>\n            <a href=\"#\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOVfQR1PzObsu1YM22xOmaf1oiuDc-uR1WKU9j2waI9Mx2MGW5YXtch6h8PI_8bIlcknfd2_P9IjTNx0Ovb6DlB4XhukBJcdzU1yT0snlwapC8fh-8=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 657px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/February%20Company%20Fellowship\n                \"\n                style=\"\n                  text-align: center;\n                  color: #ebebeb;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- FOOTER -->\n          <div\n            class=\"footer\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px; background-color: #333\"\n          >\n            <a href=\"\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMwywpNwM3ypEY8Ex92PNahXs0Jghx8fViZ8RvD4Lej1JKn63j5hfcnM2MBrI_stYKXy9qVxg3CmRP9o3XiVnnumuCSiZe6fZTnkXIycFGNHBX7QS8=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 300px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <h3 style=\"color: #fff; text-align: center; margin: 16px 0\">\n              Your Trusted Christian Partner <br />\n              in Managed Services\n            </h3>\n            <p\n              style=\"\n                color: #fff;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: 12px;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n              \"\n            >\n              We deliver end-to-end solutions and professional expertise in\n              <br />\n              web applications, websites, virtual assistants, and skills\n              development.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"icons\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center\">\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontline.business\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNEy4pqCkdZ3TI2U5_ty1rsyAr287bs1MKnE9is6Wfvg9JYCZ5AuEqQHD7jyKVINg7Oy2P6ntdVGi8qkzby1H4P2XlaoqSsrNkIQkQ9FyhWBea3x6E=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/frontline-business-solutions-inc/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPi3buvL5Un9DyKoGLP0zaolXrXyV7hP8M8IwAcvxWiaysuZxscVzw9hReEoP5j5xr1-F3Fx1JI32UEmV3pv949c33m1JbEedeUHbxh1JrcxkHxlP8=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@frontlinebusinesssolutions6578\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOFaymIU4G3nFFhSiWbsv-JRGDD31-RCXOyDulqVuIEldQDH-04FJBepWSVQRk0iTxi1Pf4hY_SoNIEEdoWBxmWXAwLX3ePScXnh-LM5846LaM6O8s=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.instagram.com/frontline.business/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPPsABBWthmMwhMnRaz0NxOwLNe_F5dyau9JBbQUAbT48kN5S7WKa1_M6SSb6awE4kFyDiIKv7prYY2wCPNfYegju-Ph0xjM9khTrzBbAb0eY8AUwA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@frontlinebusinessinc\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNF50VT3hd-2PhvM_OUWALWmBgwrHp3drnQM-wGSSP5-C-RHXP-HePnxs4W-f8dDzun14Jth78npNTahLoR-9snETM5vsIPBBvdXzJfqPS8-eYZwiA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1\">\n              <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #fff\">\n                <small>\n                  Copyright 2025, All rights reserved. <br />\n                  Baloc Road, Brgy, San Ignacio, San Pablo City, Laguna\n                  Philippines 4000<br />\n                  <br />\n                  You are receiving this email because you opted in at our\n                  website. <br />\n                </small>\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </body>\n</html>', '', '', '', '', '', '2025-05-27 15:49:34', '2025-05-27 15:49:34');
INSERT INTO `fbsv2_newsletter` (`newsletter_aid`, `newsletter_is_active`, `newsletter_subject`, `newsletter_content`, `newsletter_email_type`, `newsletter_firstname`, `newsletter_firstname_updated`, `newsletter_role`, `newsletter_role_updated`, `newsletter_created`, `newsletter_datetime`) VALUES
(4, 1, 'FBS Newsletter: March 2025', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <!--Dark Mode meta tags needed to enable Dark Mode in email client user agents-->\n    <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\" />\n    <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark only\" />\n\n    <title>FBS Marketing Website Newsletter</title>\n    <!-- CSS -->\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n      }\n      * {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        /* outline: 1px solid red; */\n      }\n      body {\n        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n        color: #333;\n      }\n      .canvas {\n        width: 700px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n      }\n      table {\n        border-spacing: 0;\n      }\n      .partnerMobile {\n        display: none;\n      }\n      .partnerDesktop {\n        display: block;\n      }\n      .renewalMobile {\n        display: none;\n      }\n      .renewalDesktop {\n        display: block;\n      }\n      .partnerMobile--block1 img {\n        width: 100% !important;\n      }\n      @media screen and (min-width: 340px) and (max-width: 520px) {\n        .canvas {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          background-color: #f9f9f9 !important;\n        }\n        .container {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          padding: 0 !important;\n          margin: 0 auto !important;\n        }\n        .newsLetter {\n          padding: 0 !important;\n        }\n        table {\n          width: 520px !important;\n        }\n        .title {\n          padding: 0 !important;\n          background-size: 100vw !important;\n          height: 127px !important;\n        }\n\n        .partnerMobile {\n          display: block;\n        }\n        .partnerDesktop {\n          display: none;\n        }\n\n        .fellowship img {\n          width: 100% !important;\n        }\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <section class=\"newsLetter\" style=\"background-color: white; padding: 0\">\n      <div\n        class=\"container\"\n        style=\"width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: white\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"canvas\">\n          <!-- TITLE -->\n          <div\n            class=\"title\"\n            style=\"\n              background-image: url(\'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczO2mnGZ7Yj2iGNuE2ljfUdDewsjbR3GzQPNmmt7SBX9DBXziGh-or05nDOyaQQyAJS-IdnVYcXnpZpcZQB-McNi7ivOGWZc5sAzcShUFGWfO_DwkR4=w2400\');\n              background-repeat: no-repeat;\n              background-size: cover;\n              background-position: center;\n              height: 205px;\n              border: none;\n            \"\n          ></div>\n          <!-- BACKGROUND IMAGE -->\n          <div\n            class=\"imageSeperator\"\n            style=\"\n              background-image: url(\'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP5vUUM81NlJQeVvXKTY8PKUBuld07dmr9pEWvV-69YsMj8d0dUxXyQwCTAac9CchHOSnRfeL-bA6QVLNscCYcL8BJrHEEuBLNAz85g5AX9zzMS39Y=w2400\');\n              background-repeat: no-repeat;\n              background-size: cover;\n              background-position: center;\n              height: 350px;\n              border: none;\n            \"\n          ></div>\n          <!-- DESC -->\n          <div\n            class=\"desc\"\n            style=\"padding: 48px 17px; background-color: #f2f2f2\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              DepEd\'s Revamped Senior High School Curriculum\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Enhancing Employability of SHS Graduates\n            </small>\n\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              The Department of Education (DepEd) is set to implement a major\n              revision of the Senior High School (SHS) curriculum starting in\n              School Year (SY) 2025-2026, aiming to enhance graduates\'\n              employability by reducing core subjects from 15 to just five or\n              six. This change will allocate more time for work immersion and\n              on-the-job training, ensuring students gain practical skills\n              aligned with industry needs. To facilitate a smooth transition, a\n              phased implementation approach will be adopted. DepEd is\n              collaborating with industry experts to refine standards in key\n              subjects like English, Science, and Mathematics, making education\n              more responsive to workforce demands. Industry partnerships, such\n              as those with Frontline Business Solutions, play a crucial role in\n              this initiative by providing students with real-world experience\n              in fields like IT, Accounting, and Administrative work, ultimately\n              preparing them for successful careers. Schools interested in\n              partnering with Frontline Business Solutions can explore their\n              work immersion program for enhanced hands-on training\n              opportunities.\n            </p>\n\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/insight/DepEd%E2%80%99s%20Revamped%20Senior%20High%20School%20Curriculum:%20Enhancing%20Employability%20of%20SHS%20Graduates\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #dbd5d5;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- TWO MILES -->\n          <div\n            class=\"twoMiles\"\n            style=\"padding: 48px 17px; background-color: #fef7ed\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              Two Miles Inc. Founder Hiro Isogawa Visits <br />\n              FBS for Annual Accounting Team Engagement\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Accounting Solutions\n            </small>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 20px 0\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMIzjo4QMUsIfXs7JcElbsLwLyKgtVz-GOvPKPkJMrXJy_x5iW51idYT78wgckP5rp6qSrdvlQ1h31aGPQCvbEg8tYVVbHxMhMuGpYX8ndnBrP81rA=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"width: 208px\"\n              />\n            </div>\n\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              Hiro Isogawa, founder of Two Miles Inc., recently visited\n              Frontline Business Solutions (FBS) for his annual engagement with\n              the accounting team, reinforcing their strong partnership in\n              outsourced bookkeeping, payroll, tax compliance, and\n              administrative support. His visit highlighted the growing\n              workforce at FBS, acknowledging their contributions and discussing\n              strategies for improving efficiency, while this annual tradition\n              reflects the trust and confidence in FBS, fostering professional\n              ties and motivating the team to continue delivering high-quality\n              accounting services.\n            </p>\n            <img\n              src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczN-_89rNMne59u8l2y-GahjBoalmhSbBqotO--mKRMPbfJwCOUpP84abBvXk00KkVqIjm7SUHh0618jGyCs6psUooMRygMbBoFsmOSqcvDDZphN3hE=w2400\"\n              alt=\"\"\n              style=\"\n                width: 100%;\n                height: 350px;\n                object-fit: cover;\n                display: block;\n              \"\n            />\n\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/Two-Miles-Inc.-Founder-Hiro-Isogawa-Visits-FBS-for-Annual%20-Accounting-Team-Engagement\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #dbd5d5;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- NEW PARTNER DESKTOP -->\n          <div\n            class=\"partnerDesktop\"\n            style=\"padding: 48px 17px; background-color: #f2f2f2\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              STI College San Pablo Kicks Off SHS Work Immersion at FBS\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Learning Center Solutions Service\n            </small>\n\n            <table\n              cellpadding=\"0\"\n              cellspacing=\"0\"\n              role=\"presentation\"\n              style=\"\n                width: 683px;\n                height: 0px;\n                padding-top: 32px;\n                text-align: center;\n              \"\n            >\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                  <a href=\"#\">\n                    <img\n                      src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPw-vtzFlicJONf2Lrf6GoFlUhisEzRw9TNx_imJv4tZYqd4W5foO_HZcmMkb-L-n8pF1UMCbEn0mwBTINMuTr7uTATrPnWfmOZxIFlckC1rXf1c5w=w2400\"\n                      alt=\"\"\n                      style=\"display: block; width: 317px\"\n                    />\n                  </a>\n                  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n                    <a\n                      class=\"btn\"\n                      href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/STI-College-Work-Immersion-Kicks-Off\"\n                      style=\"\n                        display: inline-block;\n                        color: #dbd5d5;\n                        font-weight: 300;\n                        padding: 12px 50px;\n                        background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                        border-radius: 5px;\n                        text-decoration: none;\n                        font-size: 12px;\n                      \"\n                      >Read more</a\n                    >\n                  </div>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                  <p style=\"text-align: left; padding-right: 20px\">\n                    STI College San Pablo\'s Grade 12 ICT students have\n                    officially begun their 80-hour Work Immersion Program in Web\n                    Design and Web Development! Guided by industry\n                    professionals, students will gain hands-on experience using\n                    Figma for UI/UX design and HTML & CSS for web development,\n                    bridging the gap between academics and real-world\n                    application.\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n          <!-- NEW PARTNER MOBILE -->\n          <div\n            class=\"partnerMobile\"\n            style=\"padding: 48px 17px; background-color: #f2f2f2\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              STI College San Pablo Kicks Off SHS Work Immersion at FBS\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Learning Center Solutions Service\n            </small>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"partnerMobile--block1\"\n              style=\"list-style: none; text-align: center; margin-top: 32px\"\n            >\n              <a href=\"#\">\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPw-vtzFlicJONf2Lrf6GoFlUhisEzRw9TNx_imJv4tZYqd4W5foO_HZcmMkb-L-n8pF1UMCbEn0mwBTINMuTr7uTATrPnWfmOZxIFlckC1rXf1c5w=w2400\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n                  style=\"display: block; width: 317px\"\n                />\n              </a>\n              <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 26px 0\">\n                <a\n                  class=\"btn\"\n                  href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/STI-College-Work-Immersion-Kicks-Off\"\n                  style=\"\n                    display: inline-block;\n                    color: #dbd5d5;\n                    font-weight: 300;\n                    padding: 12px 50px;\n                    background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                    border-radius: 5px;\n                    text-decoration: none;\n                    font-size: 12px;\n                  \"\n                  >Read more</a\n                >\n              </div>\n              <p style=\"text-align: left\">\n                STI College San Pablo\'s Grade 12 ICT students have officially\n                begun their 80-hour Work Immersion Program in Web Design and Web\n                Development! Guided by industry professionals, students will\n                gain hands-on experience using Figma for UI/UX design and HTML &\n                CSS for web development, bridging the gap between academics and\n                real-world application.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- WELCOME VISITORS -->\n          <div\n            class=\"welcomeVisitors\"\n            style=\"padding: 48px 17px; background-color: #fef7ed\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              FBS Welcomes Visitors from Prairie Harvest Christian Life Centre\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Company Culture and Values\n            </small>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 20px 0\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczN5KlcT-jp0aQWKgb2BC1MhX1FPRVoR3Nu_g2c6FEd0t8RmapmGiWt8KzWC1slJGniMm3uYHHjZFl99gmG0-bNcRYhHp68iCTS56c_YCONCWjLRHD8=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"width: 300px\"\n              />\n            </div>\n\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              FBS, a Christ-centered company, was honored to welcome Ptr. Des\n              Klingspon from Prairie Harvest Christian Life Centre in Yorkton,\n              Saskatchewan, Canada, along with Bro. Stefan and Sis. Chrystal\n              Bymak. Through our partnership with Philippine Frontline\n              Ministries and various churches, we continue to integrate faith\n              into our workplace and community, striving to serve with\n              excellence, honor God, and make a lasting impact.\n            </p>\n            <img\n              src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP57vfhFKQ2qZlkjAF1KPu8dv49XIip9XU83k4Nwr3zQ7jfD2TdbXMYDCJCAdjd54NA7kYXfMx9RcRSU_iIR-JZddEufU_FjQbDeQj1_ThG5wUwWIU=w2400\"\n              alt=\"\"\n              style=\"\n                width: 100%;\n                height: 350px;\n                object-fit: cover;\n                display: block;\n              \"\n            />\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/FBS-Welcomes-Visitors-from-Prairie-Harvest-Christian-Life-Centre\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #dbd5d5;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- FELLOWSHIP -->\n          <div\n            class=\"fellowship\"\n            style=\"padding: 48px 17px; background-color: #f2f2f2\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              March Company Fellowship\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Company Culture and Team Building\n            </small>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              As February is known as the month of love, Frontline Business\n              Solutions, Inc. embraced this spirit of unity and camaraderie\n              through our monthly company fellowship. With the theme \"Raising\n              the Bar, Reaching Far, the event served as a reminder of our\n              commitment to continuous growth, excellence, and teamwork.\n            </p>\n            <a href=\"#\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOVfQR1PzObsu1YM22xOmaf1oiuDc-uR1WKU9j2waI9Mx2MGW5YXtch6h8PI_8bIlcknfd2_P9IjTNx0Ovb6DlB4XhukBJcdzU1yT0snlwapC8fh-8=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 657px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/insight/DepEd%E2%80%99s%20Revamped%20Senior%20High%20School%20Curriculum:%20Enhancing%20Employability%20of%20SHS%20Graduates\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #dbd5d5;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- FOOTER -->\n          <div\n            class=\"footer\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px; background-color: #333\"\n          >\n            <a href=\"\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMwywpNwM3ypEY8Ex92PNahXs0Jghx8fViZ8RvD4Lej1JKn63j5hfcnM2MBrI_stYKXy9qVxg3CmRP9o3XiVnnumuCSiZe6fZTnkXIycFGNHBX7QS8=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 200px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <h3 style=\"color: #fff; text-align: center; margin: 16px 0\">\n              Your Trusted Christian Partner <br />\n              in Managed Services\n            </h3>\n            <p\n              style=\"\n                color: #fff;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: 12px;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n              \"\n            >\n              We deliver end-to-end solutions and professional expertise in\n              <br />\n              web applications, websites, virtual assistants, and skills\n              development.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"icons\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center\">\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontline.business\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNEy4pqCkdZ3TI2U5_ty1rsyAr287bs1MKnE9is6Wfvg9JYCZ5AuEqQHD7jyKVINg7Oy2P6ntdVGi8qkzby1H4P2XlaoqSsrNkIQkQ9FyhWBea3x6E=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/frontline-business-solutions-inc/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPi3buvL5Un9DyKoGLP0zaolXrXyV7hP8M8IwAcvxWiaysuZxscVzw9hReEoP5j5xr1-F3Fx1JI32UEmV3pv949c33m1JbEedeUHbxh1JrcxkHxlP8=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@frontlinebusinesssolutions6578\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOFaymIU4G3nFFhSiWbsv-JRGDD31-RCXOyDulqVuIEldQDH-04FJBepWSVQRk0iTxi1Pf4hY_SoNIEEdoWBxmWXAwLX3ePScXnh-LM5846LaM6O8s=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.instagram.com/frontline.business/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPPsABBWthmMwhMnRaz0NxOwLNe_F5dyau9JBbQUAbT48kN5S7WKa1_M6SSb6awE4kFyDiIKv7prYY2wCPNfYegju-Ph0xjM9khTrzBbAb0eY8AUwA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@frontlinebusinessinc\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNF50VT3hd-2PhvM_OUWALWmBgwrHp3drnQM-wGSSP5-C-RHXP-HePnxs4W-f8dDzun14Jth78npNTahLoR-9snETM5vsIPBBvdXzJfqPS8-eYZwiA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1\">\n              <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #fff\">\n                <small>\n                  Copyright 2025, All rights reserved. <br />\n                  Baloc Road, Brgy, San Ignacio, San Pablo City, Laguna\n                  Philippines 4000<br />\n                  <br />\n                  You are receiving this email because you opted in at our\n                  website. <br />\n                </small>\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </body>\n</html>', '', '', '', '', '', '2025-05-27 15:50:38', '2025-05-27 15:50:38');
INSERT INTO `fbsv2_newsletter` (`newsletter_aid`, `newsletter_is_active`, `newsletter_subject`, `newsletter_content`, `newsletter_email_type`, `newsletter_firstname`, `newsletter_firstname_updated`, `newsletter_role`, `newsletter_role_updated`, `newsletter_created`, `newsletter_datetime`) VALUES
(5, 1, 'FBS Newsletter: April 2025', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <!--Dark Mode meta tags needed to enable Dark Mode in email client user agents-->\n    <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\" />\n    <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark only\" />\n\n    <title>FBS Marketing Website Newsletter</title>\n    <!-- CSS -->\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n      }\n      * {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        /* outline: 1px solid red; */\n      }\n      body {\n        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n        color: #333;\n      }\n      .canvas {\n        width: 700px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n      }\n      table {\n        border-spacing: 0;\n      }\n      .webAppServicesMobile {\n        display: none;\n      }\n      .webAppServicesDesktop {\n        display: block;\n      }\n      .renewalMobile {\n        display: none;\n      }\n      .renewalDesktop {\n        display: block;\n      }\n      .mobileSTI {\n        display: none;\n      }\n      .desktopSTI {\n        display: block;\n      }\n\n      @media screen and (min-width: 340px) and (max-width: 520px) {\n        .canvas {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          background-color: #f9f9f9 !important;\n        }\n        .container {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          padding: 0 !important;\n          margin: 0 auto !important;\n        }\n        .newsLetter {\n          padding: 0 !important;\n        }\n        table {\n          width: 520px !important;\n        }\n        .title {\n          padding: 0 !important;\n          background-size: 100vw !important;\n          height: 127px !important;\n        }\n\n        .webAppServicesMobile {\n          display: block;\n        }\n        .webAppServicesDesktop {\n          display: none;\n        }\n        .mobileSTI {\n          display: block;\n        }\n        .desktopSTI {\n          display: none;\n        }\n        .fellowship img {\n          width: 100% !important;\n        }\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <section class=\"newsLetter\" style=\"background-color: white; padding: 0\">\n      <div\n        class=\"container\"\n        style=\"width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: white\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"canvas\">\n          <!-- TITLE -->\n          <div\n            class=\"title\"\n            style=\"\n              background-image: url(\'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAvLKsqq_TE22a93RQy9yXbMgwIsZ23x3mAbrwGpT4La71pEdoDfx_fcXA4FW_uRz9obowug74lPE3Ze7uFbBjWEx7PgyOdXsv-0ryO2hdq51oH0U=w2400\');\n              background-repeat: no-repeat;\n              background-size: cover;\n              background-position: center;\n              height: 205px;\n              border: none;\n            \"\n          ></div>\n          <!-- BACKGROUND IMAGE -->\n          <div\n            class=\"imageSeperator\"\n            style=\"\n              background-image: url(\'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMX9497z3Js-bzHX88v73QPvei5JzeL_oqbyJplK8oKg2FXriiFTeqh2TbnK_MT5o4SULLptc0XyfKr2PimhaMMNfo9GDuOpVH82qI5z3J6TeljIGA=w2400\');\n              background-repeat: no-repeat;\n              background-size: cover;\n              background-position: center;\n              height: 350px;\n              border: none;\n            \"\n          ></div>\n          <!-- DESC -->\n          <div\n            class=\"desc\"\n            style=\"padding: 48px 24px; background-color: #f2f2f2\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              Transforming Business Operations with Customized Web Applications\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Web Applications and Web Services\n            </small>\n\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              In today\'s digital-driven world, businesses need more than just a\n              website to stay competitive. Customized web applications provide\n              organizations with tailored solutions that streamline operations,\n              enhance efficiency, and improve user experience. At Frontline\n              Business Solutions, Inc., we go beyond website development by\n              delivering powerful web applications designed to meet the unique\n              needs of businesses across various industries.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"webAppServicesDesktop\">\n              <table\n                cellpadding=\"0\"\n                cellspacing=\"0\"\n                role=\"presentation\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 670px;\n                  height: 0px;\n                  padding-top: 32px;\n                  text-align: center;\n                \"\n              >\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                    <h4\n                      style=\"\n                        text-align: center;\n                        font-size: 14px;\n                        white-space: nowrap;\n                        color: #d60070;\n                        margin-bottom: 10px;\n                      \"\n                    >\n                      THE ADVANTAGES OF CUSTOMIZED <br />\n                      WEB APPLICATIONS\n                    </h4>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Tailored to Business Needs\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Scalability and Flexibility\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Improved Efficiency and Productivity\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Enhanced Security\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Seamless Integration\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                    <h4\n                      style=\"\n                        text-align: center;\n                        font-size: 14px;\n                        white-space: wrap;\n                        color: #d60070;\n                        margin-bottom: 10px;\n                      \"\n                    >\n                      OUR WEB <br />\n                      APPLICATION SOLUTIONS\n                    </h4>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      HR Information System (HRIS)\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Online Payroll System\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      School Enrollment System.\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Online Payment Integration\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Online Donation System\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Asset Inventory System\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"webAppServicesMobile\">\n              <div class=\"\" style=\"max-width: fit-content; margin: 30px auto\">\n                <h4\n                  style=\"\n                    text-align: center;\n                    font-size: 14px;\n                    white-space: nowrap;\n                    color: #d60070;\n                    margin-bottom: 10px;\n                  \"\n                >\n                  THE ADVANTAGES OF CUSTOMIZED <br />\n                  WEB APPLICATIONS\n                </h4>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Tailored to Business Needs\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Scalability and Flexibility\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Improved Efficiency and Productivity\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Enhanced Security\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Seamless Integration\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"\" style=\"max-width: fit-content; margin: 30px auto\">\n                <h4\n                  style=\"\n                    text-align: center;\n                    font-size: 14px;\n                    white-space: wrap;\n                    color: #d60070;\n                    margin-bottom: 10px;\n                  \"\n                >\n                  OUR WEB <br />\n                  APPLICATION SOLUTIONS\n                </h4>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  HR Information System (HRIS)\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Online Payroll System\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  School Enrollment System.\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Online Payment Integration\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Online Donation System\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Asset Inventory System\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/insight/transforming-business-operations-with-customized-web-applications\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #dbd5d5;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- STI -->\n          <div\n            class=\"STI\"\n            style=\"padding: 48px 24px; background-color: #fef7ed\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              21 STI College San Pablo Students Complete Work Immersion in Web\n              Design & Frontend Development\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Learning Center Solutions Service\n            </small>\n\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. proudly celebrates the\n              successful completion of 21 students from STI College San Pablo,\n              who recently finished their Senior High School Work Immersion\n              program. These students, taking the ICT (Information and\n              Communications Technology) strand, gained valuable industry\n              experience in Web Design and Frontend Development using Figma,\n              HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\n            </p>\n            <!-- desktop -->\n            <div class=\"desktopSTI\">\n              <table\n                cellpadding=\"0\"\n                cellspacing=\"0\"\n                role=\"presentation\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 670px;\n                  height: 0px;\n                  padding-top: 32px;\n                  text-align: center;\n                \"\n              >\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                    <a href=\"#\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczM5de6lWQ0jfg1LabAgUvb6irNo4h0LhMxftI3w8dJ0X0_oY2T1Q1aI6qIJ7yEZtdCiA5FzukAdNhq79vGimI68mMZneD53ruMUA0xC9YARw2jDdp0=w2400\n\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"display: block; width: 317px\"\n                    /></a>\n                  </td>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                    <a href=\"#\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPpffcSNGo-98lHNXZuNjCdgeQTsoRzAVbpZINUpNdTdIVE2EAFPguEudhcMkEifmr4KlrLOXNjpJt7KAnexR_8cccUtjqL7tKpr1bQlKagC4dWO5c=w2400\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"display: block; width: 317px\"\n                      />\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n            <!-- mobile -->\n            <div class=\"mobileSTI\">\n              <a href=\"#\">\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczM5de6lWQ0jfg1LabAgUvb6irNo4h0LhMxftI3w8dJ0X0_oY2T1Q1aI6qIJ7yEZtdCiA5FzukAdNhq79vGimI68mMZneD53ruMUA0xC9YARw2jDdp0=w2400\n\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n                  style=\"display: block; width: 317px; margin: 20px auto\"\n              /></a>\n              <a href=\"#\">\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPpffcSNGo-98lHNXZuNjCdgeQTsoRzAVbpZINUpNdTdIVE2EAFPguEudhcMkEifmr4KlrLOXNjpJt7KAnexR_8cccUtjqL7tKpr1bQlKagC4dWO5c=w2400\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n                  style=\"display: block; width: 317px; margin: 20px auto\"\n                />\n              </a>\n            </div>\n\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/21-STI-College-San-Pablo-Students-Work-Immersion-Completion\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #dbd5d5;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- FELLOWSHIP -->\n          <div\n            class=\"fellowship\"\n            style=\"padding: 48px 24px; background-color: #f2f2f2\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              Annual Team Building 2025\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Company Culture and Team Building\n            </small>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. recently held its highly\n              anticipated annual team-building event from April 28 to 30 at the\n              picturesque Sabangan Beach Resort in Laiya, San Juan, Batangas.\n              This year\'s theme, \"Raising the Bar, Reaching Far,\" encapsulated\n              the company\'s commitment to continuous growth, excellence, and\n              teamwork. Over three days, employees engaged in insightful\n              discussions, thrilling activities, and moments of reflection,\n              strengthening their bonds as one Frontline family.\n            </p>\n            <a href=\"#\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNnIQ_0-Ph5xk9RqYb4e-shoArCQjwDFVTIXAvmpCqfm6FYeoLztrrLYg8c5606_MqJ6RgXJwXEVf26dnuUPREYa5w-48Ky-lBEDVKbPFSq0dIzKhs=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 657px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/raising-the-bar,%20reaching-far:%20fbs\'-team-building-2025\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #dbd5d5;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- FOOTER -->\n          <div\n            class=\"footer\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 24px 48px; background-color: #333\"\n          >\n            <a href=\"\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMwywpNwM3ypEY8Ex92PNahXs0Jghx8fViZ8RvD4Lej1JKn63j5hfcnM2MBrI_stYKXy9qVxg3CmRP9o3XiVnnumuCSiZe6fZTnkXIycFGNHBX7QS8=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 200px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <h3 style=\"color: #fff; text-align: center; margin: 16px 0\">\n              Your Trusted Christian Partner <br />\n              in Managed Services\n            </h3>\n            <p\n              style=\"\n                color: #fff;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: 12px;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n              \"\n            >\n              We deliver end-to-end solutions and professional expertise in\n              <br />\n              web applications, websites, virtual assistants, and skills\n              development.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"icons\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center\">\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontline.business\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNEy4pqCkdZ3TI2U5_ty1rsyAr287bs1MKnE9is6Wfvg9JYCZ5AuEqQHD7jyKVINg7Oy2P6ntdVGi8qkzby1H4P2XlaoqSsrNkIQkQ9FyhWBea3x6E=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/frontline-business-solutions-inc/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPi3buvL5Un9DyKoGLP0zaolXrXyV7hP8M8IwAcvxWiaysuZxscVzw9hReEoP5j5xr1-F3Fx1JI32UEmV3pv949c33m1JbEedeUHbxh1JrcxkHxlP8=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@frontlinebusinesssolutions6578\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOFaymIU4G3nFFhSiWbsv-JRGDD31-RCXOyDulqVuIEldQDH-04FJBepWSVQRk0iTxi1Pf4hY_SoNIEEdoWBxmWXAwLX3ePScXnh-LM5846LaM6O8s=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.instagram.com/frontline.business/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPPsABBWthmMwhMnRaz0NxOwLNe_F5dyau9JBbQUAbT48kN5S7WKa1_M6SSb6awE4kFyDiIKv7prYY2wCPNfYegju-Ph0xjM9khTrzBbAb0eY8AUwA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@frontlinebusinessinc\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNF50VT3hd-2PhvM_OUWALWmBgwrHp3drnQM-wGSSP5-C-RHXP-HePnxs4W-f8dDzun14Jth78npNTahLoR-9snETM5vsIPBBvdXzJfqPS8-eYZwiA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1\">\n              <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #fff\">\n                <small>\n                  Copyright 2025, All rights reserved. <br />\n                  Baloc Road, Brgy, San Ignacio, San Pablo City, Laguna\n                  Philippines 4000<br />\n                  <br />\n                  You are receiving this email because you opted in at our\n                  website. <br />\n                </small>\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </body>\n</html>', 'Newsletter', '', '', '', '', '2025-05-27 15:51:36', '2025-05-29 09:53:20');
INSERT INTO `fbsv2_newsletter` (`newsletter_aid`, `newsletter_is_active`, `newsletter_subject`, `newsletter_content`, `newsletter_email_type`, `newsletter_firstname`, `newsletter_firstname_updated`, `newsletter_role`, `newsletter_role_updated`, `newsletter_created`, `newsletter_datetime`) VALUES
(6, 1, 'FBS Newsletter: May 2025 rrr', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <!--Dark Mode meta tags needed to enable Dark Mode in email client user agents-->\n    <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\" />\n    <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark only\" />\n    <title>HRIS and OPS Free Webinar</title>\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n      }\n      @import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;700&display=swap\");\n\n      * {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n      }\n      body {\n        font-family: \"Montserrat\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n        color: #333;\n        overflow-x: hidden;\n      }\n      img {\n        pointer-events: none !important;\n      }\n      p,\n      ul li {\n        font-size: 14px;\n      }\n      h3 {\n        line-height: 30px;\n      }\n      .canvas {\n        width: 700px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        background-color: white;\n      }\n      table {\n        border-spacing: 0;\n      }\n      table td {\n        vertical-align: middle;\n      }\n      .responsive-table {\n        margin: 0 auto;\n      }\n      .responsive-table td {\n        vertical-align: middle;\n      }\n      .responsive-table .text-content {\n        text-align: left;\n        margin-left: 20px;\n      }\n      .hide-button {\n        display: block;\n      }\n      .hidden-button-mobile {\n        display: none;\n      }\n\n      @media screen and (min-width: 340px) and (max-width: 520px) {\n        #contact-email {\n          font-size: 12px !important;\n        }\n        .hide-button {\n          display: none;\n        }\n        .hidden-button-mobile {\n          display: block;\n        }\n        table td {\n          vertical-align: top !important;\n        }\n        .canvas {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          background-color: white !important;\n        }\n        .container {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          padding: 0 !important;\n          margin: 0 auto !important;\n        }\n        .seminar {\n          padding: 0 !important;\n        }\n        .responsive-table td {\n          display: block;\n          /* text-align: center !important; */\n          padding-left: 0 !important;\n          padding-right: 0 !important;\n          width: 100% !important;\n        }\n        .responsive-table p {\n          max-width: 100% !important;\n        }\n        .responsive-table .text-content {\n          margin-left: 0;\n          text-align: center !important;\n        }\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <section class=\"seminar\" style=\"background-color: #ddd; padding: 0\">\n      <div\n        class=\"container\"\n        style=\"width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: white\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"canvas\">\n          <!-- BANNER/HERO IMAGE -->\n          <div>\n            <img\n              src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/17Wd4CgXxwK7HIceupCxgkdh5AP3oC2y6\"\n              alt=\"hero-img\"\n              style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block\"\n            />\n            <a href=\"#\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1DW5KuTBLaKYRFXdgdzypTJw2j0kNyR_J\"\n                alt=\"hero-img\"\n                style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block\"\n            /></a>\n          </div>\n          <!-- INTRODUCTION -->\n          <div style=\"padding: 32px\">\n            <div>\n              <h3 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; max-width: 488px\">\n                Revolutionize Your Business with HR and Payroll Automation\n              </h3>\n              <span\n                style=\"\n                  font-weight: bold;\n                  color: #d60070;\n                  margin-bottom: 30px;\n                  display: inline-block;\n                \"\n                >Web Applications and Web Services</span\n              >\n              <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n                Managing human resources and payroll manually can be\n                time-consuming, error-prone, and inefficient. In today\'s fast\n                paced digital landscape,businesses need to adapt smart solutions\n                that streamline operations and reduce administrative burdens.\n              </p>\n              <div>\n                <p\n                  style=\"\n                    font-weight: bold;\n                    text-transform: uppercase;\n                    margin-bottom: 10px;\n                    text-align: center;\n                  \"\n                >\n                  FREE HR AND PAYROLL AUTOMATION WEBINAR\n                </p>\n                <div style=\"width: fit-content; margin: 0 auto\">\n                  <p>June 10,2025, Tuesday</p>\n                  <p>2:00 PM to 3:00 PM</p>\n                  <p>Via Zoom</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\">\n                <a\n                  class=\"btn\"\n                  target=\"_blank\"\n                  href=\"https://share.hsforms.com/1_6gwfLp7R6au2gOl7OQ1dA5hs41\"\n                  style=\"\n                    display: inline-block;\n                    color: #ffffff;\n                    padding: 12px 50px;\n                    background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                    text-decoration: none;\n                    box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                    font-size: 10px;\n                    text-transform: uppercase;\n                    border-radius: 5px;\n                  \"\n                  >Register Now!</a\n                >\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"padding: 32px; background-color: #fef7ed\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; max-width: 633px\">\n              Completion of Our Full-Stack Development and Accounting Associate\n              Interns\n            </h3>\n            <span\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: bold;\n                color: #d60070;\n                margin-bottom: 30px;\n                display: inline-block;\n              \"\n              >Learning Center Solutions Service</span\n            >\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n              We proudly recognize and celebrate the successful completion of\n              the on-the-job training (OJT) of our full-stack development\n              interns from STI College San Pablo, Laguna State Polytechnic\n              University - San Pablo City Campus, and De La Salle University -\n              Lipa.\n            </p>\n            <table class=\"responsive-table\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding-right: 15px; padding-bottom: 30px\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/16hux-PYAgR_tNpT7gX_w8YiMhNslg8Wv\"\n                    alt=\"dela-salle-lipa\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"padding-left: 15px; padding-bottom: 30px\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1o-V2686McQWM6Q_9AiV1Mx8CvMy2u4Wi\"\n                    alt=\"dela-salle-lipa\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding-right: 15px; padding-bottom: 30px\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1SoBScQIP3tfbLxUZxfhMw-6DyyDiVQBW\"\n                    alt=\"dela-salle-lipa\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"padding-left: 15px; padding-bottom: 30px\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1n0MRSBmLhsTxj5tcRMpw0M-2wqLJ_IUT\"\n                    alt=\"dela-salle-lipa\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding-right: 15px; padding-bottom: 30px\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1YormB7BnFeGw3xu_tQRWbYUFbk-4R5Nw\"\n                    alt=\"dela-salle-lipa\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"padding-left: 15px; padding-bottom: 30px\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1Z9Wy7fUk_6EF170xjcNZJ0n6KzvbbET5\"\n                    alt=\"dela-salle-lipa\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\">\n              <a\n                target=\"_blank\"\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/celebrating-ojt-completion\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #ffffff;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                  font-size: 10px;\n                  text-transform: uppercase;\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                \"\n                >read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"padding: 32px; background-color: #f7f7f7\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold\">\n              Leadership Seminar with Mr. Robert Han\n            </h3>\n            <span\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: bold;\n                color: #d60070;\n                margin-bottom: 30px;\n                display: inline-block;\n              \"\n              >Employees Training and Development</span\n            >\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n              On May 2, 2025, the Supervisors of Frontline Business Solutions,\n              Inc. were privileged to attend a transformative leadership seminar\n              conducted by one of our esteemed business partners, Sir Robert\n              Han. The session was more than a typical leadership training—it\n              was a compelling call to lead with integrity, purpose, and faith,\n              challenging each leader to reflect on their values and how they\n              lead in both life and work.\n            </p>\n            <img\n              src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1MsMGN297O7luRXDFY70ThUtkSELcsrkV\"\n              alt=\"hero-img\"\n              style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block\"\n            />\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                target=\"_blank\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/empowering-leaders-with-purpose\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #ffffff;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                  font-size: 10px;\n                  text-transform: uppercase;\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                \"\n                >read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"padding: 32px; background-color: #fef7ed\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; max-width: 486px\">\n              FBS Joins STI College San Pablo\'s 2025 National Career Fest\n            </h3>\n            <span\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: bold;\n                color: #d60070;\n                margin-bottom: 30px;\n                display: inline-block;\n              \"\n              >Client Partnership and Network</span\n            >\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\">\n              Frontline Business Solutions proudly participated in the 2025\n              National Career Fest hosted by STI College San Pablo last May 23,\n              2025. As a long-time partner of the school in its College\n              On-The-Job Training (OJT) and Senior High School Work Immersion\n              programs, our presence at the event reaffirmed our commitment to\n              supporting the school\'s annual initiatives that equip students\n              with real-world career exposure.\n            </p>\n            <img\n              src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1mA7MvAIDsQrMaz4vryRAKS1bgshY5Qym\"\n              alt=\"hero-img\"\n              style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block\"\n            />\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                target=\"_blank\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/sti-national-career-fest\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #ffffff;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                  font-size: 10px;\n                  text-transform: uppercase;\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                \"\n                >read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"padding: 32px; background-color: #f7f7f7\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; max-width: 466px\">\n              Empowering Creatives Through Psychology-Driven Design\n            </h3>\n            <span\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: bold;\n                color: #d60070;\n                margin-bottom: 30px;\n                display: inline-block;\n              \"\n              >Employees Training and Development</span\n            >\n\n            <table class=\"responsive-table\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n                  <p style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 304px; margin-bottom: 30px\">\n                    The Learning Center Solutions department of FBS recently\n                    hosted an insightful seminar titled \"Psychology in UI/UX for\n                    Graphic Design,\" aimed at enhancing the design skills of our\n                    Virtual Assistants (VAs) and Marketing staff. The session,\n                    also joined by interested employees from other departments\n                    across Frontline Business Solutions and the wider Frontline\n                    Group of Companies, was a part of our continuous efforts to\n                    invest in our people and elevate the quality of digital\n                    assets we produce.\n                  </p>\n                  <div\n                    class=\"hide-button\"\n                    style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\"\n                  >\n                    <a\n                      class=\"btn\"\n                      target=\"_blank\"\n                      href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/empowering-creatives\"\n                      style=\"\n                        display: inline-block;\n                        color: #ffffff;\n                        padding: 12px 50px;\n                        background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                        text-decoration: none;\n                        box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                        font-size: 10px;\n                        text-transform: uppercase;\n                        border-radius: 5px;\n                      \"\n                      >read more</a\n                    >\n                  </div>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"width: 50%; vertical-align: top\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1gR4mTJAqKzq12poDqx6vtUVRkpbsaFS5\"\n                    alt=\"psychology in ui/ux for graphic design\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n            <div\n              class=\"hidden-button-mobile\"\n              style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\"\n            >\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                target=\"_blank\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/empowering-creatives\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #ffffff;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                  font-size: 10px;\n                  text-transform: uppercase;\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                \"\n                >read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"padding: 32px; background-color: #fef7ed\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; max-width: 493px\">\n              FBS Celebrates Its 7th Year with a PBB-Themed Fellowship\n            </h3>\n            <span\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: bold;\n                color: #d60070;\n                margin-bottom: 30px;\n                display: inline-block;\n              \"\n              >Company Culture and Team Building</span\n            >\n\n            <table class=\"responsive-table\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"width: 50%; vertical-align: top\">\n                  <p style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 304px; margin-bottom: 30px\">\n                    This May, Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. turned its\n                    monthly company fellowship into a festive and meaningful\n                    celebration, marked not just by milestones, but by\n                    camaraderie, creativity, and connection. Staying true to\n                    this year\'s theme, \"Raising the Bar, Reaching Far,\" the\n                    event took on a unique twist with a Pinoy Big Brother\n                    (PBB)-inspired concept—turning employees into housemates for\n                    a day filled with fun, games, and team spirit.\n                  </p>\n                  <div\n                    class=\"hide-button\"\n                    style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\"\n                  >\n                    <a\n                      class=\"btn\"\n                      target=\"_blank\"\n                      href=\"#\"\n                      style=\"\n                        display: inline-block;\n                        color: #ffffff;\n                        padding: 12px 50px;\n                        background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                        text-decoration: none;\n                        box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                        font-size: 10px;\n                        text-transform: uppercase;\n                        border-radius: 5px;\n                      \"\n                      >read more</a\n                    >\n                  </div>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"width: 50%; vertical-align: top\">\n                  <img\n                    style=\"width: 100%; display: block\"\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1mhgPwNDhZlbGJsuF2y3_lA_H8QVeJRRA\"\n                    alt=\"pinoy big brother\"\n                  />\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n            <div\n              class=\"hidden-button-mobile\"\n              style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0\"\n            >\n              <a\n                target=\"_blank\"\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #ffffff;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 0px 3px 8px;\n                  font-size: 10px;\n                  text-transform: uppercase;\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                \"\n                >read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- FOOTER -->\n          <div\n            class=\"footer\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 24px 48px; background-color: #333\"\n          >\n            <a href=\"\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMwywpNwM3ypEY8Ex92PNahXs0Jghx8fViZ8RvD4Lej1JKn63j5hfcnM2MBrI_stYKXy9qVxg3CmRP9o3XiVnnumuCSiZe6fZTnkXIycFGNHBX7QS8=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 200px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <h3 style=\"color: #fff; text-align: center; margin: 16px 0\">\n              Your Trusted Christian Partner <br />\n              in Managed Services\n            </h3>\n            <p\n              style=\"\n                color: #fff;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: 12px;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n              \"\n            >\n              We deliver end-to-end solutions and professional expertise in\n              <br />\n              web applications, websites, virtual assistants, and skills\n              development.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"icons\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center\">\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontline.business\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNEy4pqCkdZ3TI2U5_ty1rsyAr287bs1MKnE9is6Wfvg9JYCZ5AuEqQHD7jyKVINg7Oy2P6ntdVGi8qkzby1H4P2XlaoqSsrNkIQkQ9FyhWBea3x6E=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/frontline-business-solutions-inc/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPi3buvL5Un9DyKoGLP0zaolXrXyV7hP8M8IwAcvxWiaysuZxscVzw9hReEoP5j5xr1-F3Fx1JI32UEmV3pv949c33m1JbEedeUHbxh1JrcxkHxlP8=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@frontlinebusinesssolutions6578\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOFaymIU4G3nFFhSiWbsv-JRGDD31-RCXOyDulqVuIEldQDH-04FJBepWSVQRk0iTxi1Pf4hY_SoNIEEdoWBxmWXAwLX3ePScXnh-LM5846LaM6O8s=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.instagram.com/frontline.business/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPPsABBWthmMwhMnRaz0NxOwLNe_F5dyau9JBbQUAbT48kN5S7WKa1_M6SSb6awE4kFyDiIKv7prYY2wCPNfYegju-Ph0xjM9khTrzBbAb0eY8AUwA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@frontlinebusinessinc\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNF50VT3hd-2PhvM_OUWALWmBgwrHp3drnQM-wGSSP5-C-RHXP-HePnxs4W-f8dDzun14Jth78npNTahLoR-9snETM5vsIPBBvdXzJfqPS8-eYZwiA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1\">\n              <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #fff\">\n                <small>\n                  Copyright 2025, All rights reserved. <br />\n                  Baloc Road, Brgy, San Ignacio, San Pablo City, Laguna\n                  Philippines 4000<br />\n                  <br />\n                  You are receiving this email because you opted in at our\n                  website. <br />\n                </small>\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </body>\n</html>\n', 'Newsletter', '', '', '', '', '2025-05-29 09:45:43', '2025-05-29 09:48:23'),
