uctivity\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Enhanced Security\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Seamless Integration\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"\" style=\"max-width: fit-content; margin: 30px auto\">\n                <h4\n                  style=\"\n                    text-align: center;\n                    font-size: 14px;\n                    white-space: wrap;\n                    color: #d60070;\n                    margin-bottom: 10px;\n                  \"\n                >\n                  OUR WEB <br />\n                  APPLICATION SOLUTIONS\n                </h4>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  HR Information System (HRIS)\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Online Payroll System\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  School Enrollment System.\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Online Payment Integration\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Online Donation System\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Asset Inventory System\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/insight/transforming-business-operations-with-customized-web-applications\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #dbd5d5;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- STI -->\n          <div\n            class=\"STI\"\n            style=\"padding: 48px 24px; background-color: #fef7ed\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              21 STI College San Pablo Students Complete Work Immersion in Web\n              Design & Frontend Development\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Learning Center Solutions Service\n            </small>\n\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. proudly celebrates the\n              successful completion of 21 students from STI College San Pablo,\n              who recently finished their Senior High School Work Immersion\n              program. These students, taking the ICT (Information and\n              Communications Technology) strand, gained valuable industry\n              experience in Web Design and Frontend Development using Figma,\n              HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\n            </p>\n            <!-- desktop -->\n            <div class=\"desktopSTI\">\n              <table\n                cellpadding=\"0\"\n                cellspacing=\"0\"\n                role=\"presentation\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 670px;\n                  height: 0px;\n                  padding-top: 32px;\n                  text-align: center;\n                \"\n              >\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                    <a href=\"#\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczM5de6lWQ0jfg1LabAgUvb6irNo4h0LhMxftI3w8dJ0X0_oY2T1Q1aI6qIJ7yEZtdCiA5FzukAdNhq79vGimI68mMZneD53ruMUA0xC9YARw2jDdp0=w2400\n\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"display: block; width: 317px\"\n                    /></a>\n                  </td>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                    <a href=\"#\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPpffcSNGo-98lHNXZuNjCdgeQTsoRzAVbpZINUpNdTdIVE2EAFPguEudhcMkEifmr4KlrLOXNjpJt7KAnexR_8cccUtjqL7tKpr1bQlKagC4dWO5c=w2400\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"display: block; width: 317px\"\n                      />\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n            <!-- mobile -->\n            <div class=\"mobileSTI\">\n              <a href=\"#\">\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczM5de6lWQ0jfg1LabAgUvb6irNo4h0LhMxftI3w8dJ0X0_oY2T1Q1aI6qIJ7yEZtdCiA5FzukAdNhq79vGimI68mMZneD53ruMUA0xC9YARw2jDdp0=w2400\n\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n                  style=\"display: block; width: 317px; margin: 20px auto\"\n              /></a>\n              <a href=\"#\">\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPpffcSNGo-98lHNXZuNjCdgeQTsoRzAVbpZINUpNdTdIVE2EAFPguEudhcMkEifmr4KlrLOXNjpJt7KAnexR_8cccUtjqL7tKpr1bQlKagC4dWO5c=w2400\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n                  style=\"display: block; width: 317px; margin: 20px auto\"\n                />\n              </a>\n            </div>\n\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/21-STI-College-San-Pablo-Students-Work-Immersion-Completion\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #dbd5d5;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- FELLOWSHIP -->\n          <div\n            class=\"fellowship\"\n            style=\"padding: 48px 24px; background-color: #f2f2f2\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              Annual Team Building 2025\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Company Culture and Team Building\n            </small>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. recently held its highly\n              anticipated annual team-building event from April 28 to 30 at the\n              picturesque Sabangan Beach Resort in Laiya, San Juan, Batangas.\n              This year\'s theme, \"Raising the Bar, Reaching Far,\" encapsulated\n              the company\'s commitment to continuous growth, excellence, and\n              teamwork. Over three days, employees engaged in insightful\n              discussions, thrilling activities, and moments of reflection,\n              strengthening their bonds as one Frontline family.\n            </p>\n            <a href=\"#\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNnIQ_0-Ph5xk9RqYb4e-shoArCQjwDFVTIXAvmpCqfm6FYeoLztrrLYg8c5606_MqJ6RgXJwXEVf26dnuUPREYa5w-48Ky-lBEDVKbPFSq0dIzKhs=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 657px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/raising-the-bar,%20reaching-far:%20fbs\'-team-building-2025\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #dbd5d5;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- FOOTER -->\n          <div\n            class=\"footer\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 24px 48px; background-color: #333\"\n          >\n            <a href=\"\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMwywpNwM3ypEY8Ex92PNahXs0Jghx8fViZ8RvD4Lej1JKn63j5hfcnM2MBrI_stYKXy9qVxg3CmRP9o3XiVnnumuCSiZe6fZTnkXIycFGNHBX7QS8=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 200px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <h3 style=\"color: #fff; text-align: center; margin: 16px 0\">\n              Your Trusted Christian Partner <br />\n              in Managed Services\n            </h3>\n            <p\n              style=\"\n                color: #fff;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: 12px;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n              \"\n            >\n              We deliver end-to-end solutions and professional expertise in\n              <br />\n              web applications, websites, virtual assistants, and skills\n              development.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"icons\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center\">\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontline.business\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNEy4pqCkdZ3TI2U5_ty1rsyAr287bs1MKnE9is6Wfvg9JYCZ5AuEqQHD7jyKVINg7Oy2P6ntdVGi8qkzby1H4P2XlaoqSsrNkIQkQ9FyhWBea3x6E=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/frontline-business-solutions-inc/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPi3buvL5Un9DyKoGLP0zaolXrXyV7hP8M8IwAcvxWiaysuZxscVzw9hReEoP5j5xr1-F3Fx1JI32UEmV3pv949c33m1JbEedeUHbxh1JrcxkHxlP8=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@frontlinebusinesssolutions6578\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOFaymIU4G3nFFhSiWbsv-JRGDD31-RCXOyDulqVuIEldQDH-04FJBepWSVQRk0iTxi1Pf4hY_SoNIEEdoWBxmWXAwLX3ePScXnh-LM5846LaM6O8s=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.instagram.com/frontline.business/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPPsABBWthmMwhMnRaz0NxOwLNe_F5dyau9JBbQUAbT48kN5S7WKa1_M6SSb6awE4kFyDiIKv7prYY2wCPNfYegju-Ph0xjM9khTrzBbAb0eY8AUwA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@frontlinebusinessinc\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNF50VT3hd-2PhvM_OUWALWmBgwrHp3drnQM-wGSSP5-C-RHXP-HePnxs4W-f8dDzun14Jth78npNTahLoR-9snETM5vsIPBBvdXzJfqPS8-eYZwiA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1\">\n              <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #fff\">\n                <small>\n                  Copyright 2025, All rights reserved. <br />\n                  Baloc Road, Brgy, San Ignacio, San Pablo City, Laguna\n                  Philippines 4000<br />\n                  <br />\n                  You are receiving this email because you opted in at our\n                  website. <br />\n                </small>\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </body>\n</html>', 1, '47e26eaffab557f0aea866fb313e311a713431a378080cf9210c02ddce4776e0', '', '', '', '', '2025-03-03 11:49:25', '2025-05-07 12:24:32');
INSERT INTO `fbsv2_sending_email_log` (`sending_email_log_aid`, `sending_email_log_is_active`, `sending_email_log_audience_id`, `sending_email_log_email`, `sending_email_log_subject`, `sending_email_log_content`, `sending_email_log_is_success`, `sending_email_log_key`, `sending_email_log_firstname`, `sending_email_log_role`, `sending_email_log_firstname_resend`, `sending_email_log_role_resend`, `sending_email_log_created`, `sending_email_log_datetime`) VALUES
(13, 1, 8, 'lourenisobel18@gmail.com', 'Test Newsletter April 2025 ito', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <!--Dark Mode meta tags needed to enable Dark Mode in email client user agents-->\n    <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\" />\n    <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark only\" />\n\n    <title>FBS Marketing Website Newsletter</title>\n    <!-- CSS -->\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n      }\n      * {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        /* outline: 1px solid red; */\n      }\n      body {\n        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n        color: #333;\n      }\n      .canvas {\n        width: 700px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n      }\n      table {\n        border-spacing: 0;\n      }\n      .webAppServicesMobile {\n        display: none;\n      }\n      .webAppServicesDesktop {\n        display: block;\n      }\n      .renewalMobile {\n        display: none;\n      }\n      .renewalDesktop {\n        display: block;\n      }\n      .mobileSTI {\n        display: none;\n      }\n      .desktopSTI {\n        display: block;\n      }\n\n      @media screen and (min-width: 340px) and (max-width: 520px) {\n        .canvas {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          background-color: #f9f9f9 !important;\n        }\n        .container {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          padding: 0 !important;\n          margin: 0 auto !important;\n        }\n        .newsLetter {\n          padding: 0 !important;\n        }\n        table {\n          width: 520px !important;\n        }\n        .title {\n          padding: 0 !important;\n          background-size: 100vw !important;\n          height: 127px !important;\n        }\n\n        .webAppServicesMobile {\n          display: block;\n        }\n        .webAppServicesDesktop {\n          display: none;\n        }\n        .mobileSTI {\n          display: block;\n        }\n        .desktopSTI {\n          display: none;\n        }\n        .fellowship img {\n          width: 100% !important;\n        }\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <section class=\"newsLetter\" style=\"background-color: white; padding: 0\">\n      <div\n        class=\"container\"\n        style=\"width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: white\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"canvas\">\n          <!-- TITLE -->\n          <div\n            class=\"title\"\n            style=\"\n              background-image: url(\'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAvLKsqq_TE22a93RQy9yXbMgwIsZ23x3mAbrwGpT4La71pEdoDfx_fcXA4FW_uRz9obowug74lPE3Ze7uFbBjWEx7PgyOdXsv-0ryO2hdq51oH0U=w2400\');\n              background-repeat: no-repeat;\n              background-size: cover;\n              background-position: center;\n              height: 205px;\n              border: none;\n            \"\n          ></div>\n          <!-- BACKGROUND IMAGE -->\n          <div\n            class=\"imageSeperator\"\n            style=\"\n              background-image: url(\'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMX9497z3Js-bzHX88v73QPvei5JzeL_oqbyJplK8oKg2FXriiFTeqh2TbnK_MT5o4SULLptc0XyfKr2PimhaMMNfo9GDuOpVH82qI5z3J6TeljIGA=w2400\');\n              background-repeat: no-repeat;\n              background-size: cover;\n              background-position: center;\n              height: 350px;\n              border: none;\n            \"\n          ></div>\n          <!-- DESC -->\n          <div\n            class=\"desc\"\n            style=\"padding: 48px 24px; background-color: #f2f2f2\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              Transforming Business Operations with Customized Web Applications\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Web Applications and Web Services\n            </small>\n\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              In today\'s digital-driven world, businesses need more than just a\n              website to stay competitive. Customized web applications provide\n              organizations with tailored solutions that streamline operations,\n              enhance efficiency, and improve user experience. At Frontline\n              Business Solutions, Inc., we go beyond website development by\n              delivering powerful web applications designed to meet the unique\n              needs of businesses across various industries.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"webAppServicesDesktop\">\n              <table\n                cellpadding=\"0\"\n                cellspacing=\"0\"\n                role=\"presentation\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 670px;\n                  height: 0px;\n                  padding-top: 32px;\n                  text-align: center;\n                \"\n              >\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                    <h4\n                      style=\"\n                        text-align: center;\n                        font-size: 14px;\n                        white-space: nowrap;\n                        color: #d60070;\n                        margin-bottom: 10px;\n                      \"\n                    >\n                      THE ADVANTAGES OF CUSTOMIZED <br />\n                      WEB APPLICATIONS\n                    </h4>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Tailored to Business Needs\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Scalability and Flexibility\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Improved Efficiency and Productivity\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Enhanced Security\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Seamless Integration\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                    <h4\n                      style=\"\n                        text-align: center;\n                        font-size: 14px;\n                        white-space: wrap;\n                        color: #d60070;\n                        margin-bottom: 10px;\n                      \"\n                    >\n                      OUR WEB <br />\n                      APPLICATION SOLUTIONS\n                    </h4>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      HR Information System (HRIS)\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Online Payroll System\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      School Enrollment System.\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Online Payment Integration\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Online Donation System\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                      />\n\n                      Asset Inventory System\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"webAppServicesMobile\">\n              <div class=\"\" style=\"max-width: fit-content; margin: 30px auto\">\n                <h4\n                  style=\"\n                    text-align: center;\n                    font-size: 14px;\n                    white-space: nowrap;\n                    color: #d60070;\n                    margin-bottom: 10px;\n                  \"\n                >\n                  THE ADVANTAGES OF CUSTOMIZED <br />\n                  WEB APPLICATIONS\n                </h4>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Tailored to Business Needs\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Scalability and Flexibility\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Improved Efficiency and Productivity\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Enhanced Security\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPKRBc-6gVACQXmYzcfxWGLMR9zzLy4LvcnjJ6a4uVWCd8qyinvBxU8gL_ibOCdbtXK4bmTPj8oAFCZ0BLV2UjB-jsp1JmyMwQt3yg9oAGlcK5sIso=s176-p-k\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Seamless Integration\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"\" style=\"max-width: fit-content; margin: 30px auto\">\n                <h4\n                  style=\"\n                    text-align: center;\n                    font-size: 14px;\n                    white-space: wrap;\n                    color: #d60070;\n                    margin-bottom: 10px;\n                  \"\n                >\n                  OUR WEB <br />\n                  APPLICATION SOLUTIONS\n                </h4>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  HR Information System (HRIS)\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Online Payroll System\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  School Enrollment System.\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Online Payment Integration\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Online Donation System\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"vertical-align: bottom; text-align: left\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOAzFGklbHPzOWs0O7_GWTFtdCSW2DIe_2efo6Smjz35HYae1YVqaklVjFHlXDHLsBmc-FcwKvfRCbnlscljHelppCDRJ_N_ksuFYwD_QS5PHZFjdY=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"width: 16px; margin-right: 10px\"\n                  />\n\n                  Asset Inventory System\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/insight/transforming-business-operations-with-customized-web-applications\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #dbd5d5;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- STI -->\n          <div\n            class=\"STI\"\n            style=\"padding: 48px 24px; background-color: #fef7ed\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              21 STI College San Pablo Students Complete Work Immersion in Web\n              Design & Frontend Development\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Learning Center Solutions Service\n            </small>\n\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. proudly celebrates the\n              successful completion of 21 students from STI College San Pablo,\n              who recently finished their Senior High School Work Immersion\n              program. These students, taking the ICT (Information and\n              Communications Technology) strand, gained valuable industry\n              experience in Web Design and Frontend Development using Figma,\n              HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\n            </p>\n            <!-- desktop -->\n            <div class=\"desktopSTI\">\n              <table\n                cellpadding=\"0\"\n                cellspacing=\"0\"\n                role=\"presentation\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 670px;\n                  height: 0px;\n                  padding-top: 32px;\n                  text-align: center;\n                \"\n              >\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                    <a href=\"#\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczM5de6lWQ0jfg1LabAgUvb6irNo4h0LhMxftI3w8dJ0X0_oY2T1Q1aI6qIJ7yEZtdCiA5FzukAdNhq79vGimI68mMZneD53ruMUA0xC9YARw2jDdp0=w2400\n\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"display: block; width: 317px\"\n                    /></a>\n                  </td>\n                  <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                    <a href=\"#\">\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPpffcSNGo-98lHNXZuNjCdgeQTsoRzAVbpZINUpNdTdIVE2EAFPguEudhcMkEifmr4KlrLOXNjpJt7KAnexR_8cccUtjqL7tKpr1bQlKagC4dWO5c=w2400\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                        style=\"display: block; width: 317px\"\n                      />\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n            <!-- mobile -->\n            <div class=\"mobileSTI\">\n              <a href=\"#\">\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczM5de6lWQ0jfg1LabAgUvb6irNo4h0LhMxftI3w8dJ0X0_oY2T1Q1aI6qIJ7yEZtdCiA5FzukAdNhq79vGimI68mMZneD53ruMUA0xC9YARw2jDdp0=w2400\n\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n                  style=\"display: block; width: 317px; margin: 20px auto\"\n              /></a>\n              <a href=\"#\">\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPpffcSNGo-98lHNXZuNjCdgeQTsoRzAVbpZINUpNdTdIVE2EAFPguEudhcMkEifmr4KlrLOXNjpJt7KAnexR_8cccUtjqL7tKpr1bQlKagC4dWO5c=w2400\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n                  style=\"display: block; width: 317px; margin: 20px auto\"\n                />\n              </a>\n            </div>\n\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/21-STI-College-San-Pablo-Students-Work-Immersion-Completion\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #dbd5d5;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- FELLOWSHIP -->\n          <div\n            class=\"fellowship\"\n            style=\"padding: 48px 24px; background-color: #f2f2f2\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              Annual Team Building 2025\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Company Culture and Team Building\n            </small>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. recently held its highly\n              anticipated annual team-building event from April 28 to 30 at the\n              picturesque Sabangan Beach Resort in Laiya, San Juan, Batangas.\n              This year\'s theme, \"Raising the Bar, Reaching Far,\" encapsulated\n              the company\'s commitment to continuous growth, excellence, and\n              teamwork. Over three days, employees engaged in insightful\n              discussions, thrilling activities, and moments of reflection,\n              strengthening their bonds as one Frontline family.\n            </p>\n            <a href=\"#\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNnIQ_0-Ph5xk9RqYb4e-shoArCQjwDFVTIXAvmpCqfm6FYeoLztrrLYg8c5606_MqJ6RgXJwXEVf26dnuUPREYa5w-48Ky-lBEDVKbPFSq0dIzKhs=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 657px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/raising-the-bar,%20reaching-far:%20fbs\'-team-building-2025\"\n                style=\"\n                  display: inline-block;\n                  color: #dbd5d5;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #d60070, #6a1142);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- FOOTER -->\n          <div\n            class=\"footer\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 24px 48px; background-color: #333\"\n          >\n            <a href=\"\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMwywpNwM3ypEY8Ex92PNahXs0Jghx8fViZ8RvD4Lej1JKn63j5hfcnM2MBrI_stYKXy9qVxg3CmRP9o3XiVnnumuCSiZe6fZTnkXIycFGNHBX7QS8=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 200px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <h3 style=\"color: #fff; text-align: center; margin: 16px 0\">\n              Your Trusted Christian Partner <br />\n              in Managed Services\n            </h3>\n            <p\n              style=\"\n                color: #fff;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: 12px;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n              \"\n            >\n              We deliver end-to-end solutions and professional expertise in\n              <br />\n              web applications, websites, virtual assistants, and skills\n              development.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"icons\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center\">\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontline.business\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNEy4pqCkdZ3TI2U5_ty1rsyAr287bs1MKnE9is6Wfvg9JYCZ5AuEqQHD7jyKVINg7Oy2P6ntdVGi8qkzby1H4P2XlaoqSsrNkIQkQ9FyhWBea3x6E=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/frontline-business-solutions-inc/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPi3buvL5Un9DyKoGLP0zaolXrXyV7hP8M8IwAcvxWiaysuZxscVzw9hReEoP5j5xr1-F3Fx1JI32UEmV3pv949c33m1JbEedeUHbxh1JrcxkHxlP8=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@frontlinebusinesssolutions6578\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOFaymIU4G3nFFhSiWbsv-JRGDD31-RCXOyDulqVuIEldQDH-04FJBepWSVQRk0iTxi1Pf4hY_SoNIEEdoWBxmWXAwLX3ePScXnh-LM5846LaM6O8s=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.instagram.com/frontline.business/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPPsABBWthmMwhMnRaz0NxOwLNe_F5dyau9JBbQUAbT48kN5S7WKa1_M6SSb6awE4kFyDiIKv7prYY2wCPNfYegju-Ph0xjM9khTrzBbAb0eY8AUwA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@frontlinebusinessinc\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNF50VT3hd-2PhvM_OUWALWmBgwrHp3drnQM-wGSSP5-C-RHXP-HePnxs4W-f8dDzun14Jth78npNTahLoR-9snETM5vsIPBBvdXzJfqPS8-eYZwiA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1\">\n              <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #fff\">\n                <small>\n                  Copyright 2025, All rights reserved. <br />\n                  Baloc Road, Brgy, San Ignacio, San Pablo City, Laguna\n                  Philippines 4000<br />\n               