ackground: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                      border-radius: 5px;\n                      text-decoration: none;\n                      font-size: 12px;\n                    \"\n                    >Read more</a\n                  >\n                </div>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"renewalMobile--block2\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: left\">\n                  FBS is proud to announce the renewal of its partnership with\n                  San Pablo Colleges for their Senior High School Work Immersion\n                  Program this 2025. This continued collaboration underscores\n                  both institutions\' shared commitment to providing students\n                  with invaluable real-world experience and practical skills\n                  that will prepare them for future career success.\n                </p>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <!-- FELLOWSHIP -->\n          <div\n            class=\"fellowship\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px; background-color: #f2f2f2\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              February Company Fellowship\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Company Culture and Team Building\n            </small>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              As February is known as the month of love, Frontline Business\n              Solutions, Inc. embraced this spirit of unity and camaraderie\n              through our monthly company fellowship. With the theme \"Raising\n              the Bar, Reaching Far, the event served as a reminder of our\n              commitment to continuous growth, excellence, and teamwork.\n            </p>\n            <a href=\"#\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOVfQR1PzObsu1YM22xOmaf1oiuDc-uR1WKU9j2waI9Mx2MGW5YXtch6h8PI_8bIlcknfd2_P9IjTNx0Ovb6DlB4XhukBJcdzU1yT0snlwapC8fh-8=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 657px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/February%20Company%20Fellowship\n                \"\n                style=\"\n                  text-align: center;\n                  color: #ebebeb;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- FOOTER -->\n          <div\n            class=\"footer\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px; background-color: #333\"\n          >\n            <a href=\"\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMwywpNwM3ypEY8Ex92PNahXs0Jghx8fViZ8RvD4Lej1JKn63j5hfcnM2MBrI_stYKXy9qVxg3CmRP9o3XiVnnumuCSiZe6fZTnkXIycFGNHBX7QS8=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 300px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <h3 style=\"color: #fff; text-align: center; margin: 16px 0\">\n              Your Trusted Christian Partner <br />\n              in Managed Services\n            </h3>\n            <p\n              style=\"\n                color: #fff;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: 12px;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n              \"\n            >\n              We deliver end-to-end solutions and professional expertise in\n              <br />\n              web applications, websites, virtual assistants, and skills\n              development.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"icons\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center\">\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontline.business\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNEy4pqCkdZ3TI2U5_ty1rsyAr287bs1MKnE9is6Wfvg9JYCZ5AuEqQHD7jyKVINg7Oy2P6ntdVGi8qkzby1H4P2XlaoqSsrNkIQkQ9FyhWBea3x6E=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/frontline-business-solutions-inc/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPi3buvL5Un9DyKoGLP0zaolXrXyV7hP8M8IwAcvxWiaysuZxscVzw9hReEoP5j5xr1-F3Fx1JI32UEmV3pv949c33m1JbEedeUHbxh1JrcxkHxlP8=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@frontlinebusinesssolutions6578\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOFaymIU4G3nFFhSiWbsv-JRGDD31-RCXOyDulqVuIEldQDH-04FJBepWSVQRk0iTxi1Pf4hY_SoNIEEdoWBxmWXAwLX3ePScXnh-LM5846LaM6O8s=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n            