n                        href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/webapp-hris\"\n                        style=\"color: #333; text-decoration: none\"\n                        >Happier Teams\n                      </a>\n                    </p>\n                  </li>\n                  <li>\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 16px\">\n                      <img\n                        style=\"width: 17px; margin-right: 3px\"\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczO9_y-8JtrBYx_5t8a4FjbHQshcn8godcmFE2Zbsyr2cYH6UOzyEOzNzPSbz1_7anGSIRJoIZ_mQj2QGefQTbGmrinW6KeICw6sINIyj8eu7axqGWxF-KvJeRbokZSCz-4xPF6pCdD45h6Oc3v4Mpm3=w21-h22-s-no-gm?authuser=0\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                      />\n                      <a\n                        href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/webapp-hris\"\n                        style=\"color: #333; text-decoration: none\"\n                      >\n                        Better Control\n                      </a>\n                    </p>\n                  </li>\n                  <li>\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 16px\">\n                      <img\n                        style=\"width: 17px; margin-right: 3px\"\n                        src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczO9_y-8JtrBYx_5t8a4FjbHQshcn8godcmFE2Zbsyr2cYH6UOzyEOzNzPSbz1_7anGSIRJoIZ_mQj2QGefQTbGmrinW6KeICw6sINIyj8eu7axqGWxF-KvJeRbokZSCz-4xPF6pCdD45h6Oc3v4Mpm3=w21-h22-s-no-gm?authuser=0\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                      />\n                      <a\n                        href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/webapp-hris\"\n                        style=\"color: #333; text-decoration: none\"\n                      >\n                        Improved Productivity\n                      </a>\n                    </p>\n                  </li>\n                </ul>\n                <div style=\"text-align: center\">\n                  <a\n                    class=\"btn\"\n                    href=\"https://calendly.com/carlodm-fbs/demo-discovery-call?month=2025-01\"\n                    style=\"\n                      color: white;\n                      font-weight: 600;\n                      padding: 12px 50px;\n                      background-color: #6a1142;\n                      border-radius: 30px;\n                      text-decoration: none;\n                    \"\n                    >BOOK A DEMO</a\n                  >\n                </div>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </table>\n          <!-- BOTTOM DESC -->\n          <div\n            class=\"bottomDesc\"\n            style=\"background-color: #a88746; padding: 24px; color: white\"\n          >\n            <h4\n              style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 14px\"\n            >\n              Your Trusted Christian Partner <br />\n              in Managed Services\n            </h4>\n\n            <p style=\"line-height: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 16px\">\n              <small>\n                We deliver end-to-end solutions and professional expertise in\n                web applications, websites, virtual assistants, and skills\n                development.\n              </small>\n            </p>\n          </div>\n          <!-- FOOTER -->\n          <div\n            class=\"footer\"\n            style=\"\n              padding: 32px 0;\n              margin-bottom: 0;\n              text-align: center;\n              background-color: #fff;\n            \"\n          >\n            <div class=\"icons\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px\">\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontline.business\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/facebook-png.png\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              