(1, 'Our Web Application Is Perfect', 'for Your HR Specific Needs.', '[{\"name\":\"hrisscreenshot-overview.png\",\"id\":\"13Ri0v-s6bN1vL1vvNQZdwL9TG1jp8w7g\",\"datetime\":\"2025-05-20 15:09:48\"}]', 'Compatibility', 'Compatible with various timekeeping tools and terminals, both biometric and non-biometric, for easy customization for importing and extracting employee time data.', 'Flexibility', 'Accessible anytime and anywhere, and fully mobile-ready to accommodate the dynamic needs of your organization.', 'Customizable', 'Tailored to meet the specific requirements and unique needs of your organization.', '2025-05-20 14:44:18', '2025-05-21 15:01:37');

