(1, 'Simplify Your Payroll Processing With Our', 'Online Payroll System', 'Our Online Payroll System simplifies payroll management for Philippine businesses by automating salary calculations, tax compliance, and government contributions, ensuring accuracy and timely payouts. With real-time reporting and employee self-service access to payslips, it reduces HR workload and boosts efficiency.', 'Schedule a demo', 'https://calendly.com/carlodm-fbs/demo-discovery-call', '[{\"name\":\"servicesbanner.webp\",\"id\":\"1o9HIJsu2UNt1_pp6uO9RmFxH1ivNaSZn\",\"datetime\":\"2025-05-22 17:00:13\"}]', '2025-05-22 10:40:01', '2025-05-23 07:56:54');

